data.value:
What changes: Microsoft Defender stops scanning these folders in real time: {0}
Risk: a malicious file placed inside them would not be detected while it runs. Only install games from Steam or Epic there.
How to undo it: revert this setting in Zentra, or remove the exclusions in Windows Security > Virus & threat protection > Exclusions.

Zentra closed while it was applying changes. They were kept so they can be reverted:
{0}
Check those settings in Optimize: revert them, or apply them again to finish.
